PERMITTED WITHOUT ASKING

  1. Downloading the Mod from an official source (the Modrinth page or the
     GitHub releases of this repository) and playing with it.
  2. Including the unmodified Mod in modpacks, public or private. Where the
     platform allows it, the modpack should download the Mod from an official
     source instead of bundling the file. Where bundling is required, the
     modpack must name the Mod and link to an official source.
  3. Showing the Mod in videos, streams, screenshots and reviews.
  4. Reading the source code and building it for your own private use, for
     example to test or debug it.
  5. Proposing changes through pull requests to this repository (see
     CONTRIBUTIONS below).

NOT PERMITTED WITHOUT PRIOR WRITTEN PERMISSION OF THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER

